               "text": "#### Writing to Soroban\n\nThis is the first text in a series that teaches how to use the Soroban (算盤). In this text you will represent numbers from 0 to 9. Work only with the first column from the right; later texts will use the whole abacus.\n\nThe marker on top (red) has value 5, and the marker below (blue) has value 1. Set the values requested in the yellow box near the 'Value' box.",
